# SALIS AUTO — app environment
#
# By default the app runs entirely on the design-bundle mock data (no server
# needed) — this is how the deployed GitHub Pages demo works. To point the same
# screens at the real API instead, set VITE_API_BASE_URL and restart the dev
# server (or rebuild). Login then authenticates against POST /auth/login and
# every screen reads through the HTTP repository.
#
# Run the backend from ../server (`npm install && npm run dev`, port 4000).
# Seeded demo login: any role's email, password `salis1234`.

# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:4000
